    "id": 32,
    "title": "Software Tool Reviews",
    "content": "<style id=\"lmt-design-v2\">\n:root{--lmt-ink:#1f2520;--lmt-muted:#626861;--lmt-canvas:#fbfaf7;--lmt-surface:#ffffff;--lmt-soft:#f3f1eb;--lmt-line:#dedbd2;--lmt-line-strong:#c8c3b7;--lmt-navy:#0a1530;--lmt-teal:#0b6b5b;--lmt-blue:#155eef;--lmt-orange:#c75234;--lmt-yellow:#f5d75e;--lmt-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.05),0 8px 24px rgba(31,37,32,.08)}\nbody{background:var(--lmt-canvas);color:var(--lmt-ink);font-family:Inter,system-ui,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;text-rendering:optimizeLegibility}body a{color:#0b5cad;text-decoration-thickness:1px;text-underline-offset:3px}body a:hover{color:#083f77}.wp-site-blocks{background:var(--lmt-canvas)}header.wp-block-template-part{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:50;background:rgba(251,250,247,.92);backdrop-filter:saturate(160%) blur(12px);border-bottom:1px solid var(--lmt-line)}header.wp-block-template-part a{text-decoration:none}footer.wp-block-template-part{border-top:1px solid var(--lmt-line);background:#fff}.lmt-wrap,.lmt-hub,.lmt-blog{max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;padding:28px 18px;color:var(--lmt-ink);font-size:17px;line-height:1.68}.lmt-wrap *,.lmt-hub *,.lmt-blog *{box-sizing:border-box}.lmt-hero{display:grid;gap:24px;align-items:start;padding:40px 0 34px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--lmt-line)}.lmt-hero-split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.15fr) minmax(280px,.85fr);gap:28px;align-items:stretch}.lmt-kicker,.lmt-eyebrow{display:inline-flex;width:max-content;align-items:center;gap:8px;border:1px solid #cfe3dc;background:#edf7f3;color:#075747;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 10px;font-size:12px;font-weight:750;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:0}.lmt-h1{font-size:clamp(36px,5vw,58px);line-height:1.06;margin:12px 0 16px;letter-spacing:0;font-weight:760}.lmt-lead{font-size:clamp(18px,2vw,21px);line-height:1.58;color:var(--lmt-muted);max-width:820px;margin:0}.lmt-actions{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;margin:24px 0}.lmt-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:8px;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 16px;min-height:46px;text-decoration:none!important;font-weight:750;line-height:1.2;border:1px solid transparent;transition:transform .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease,background .16s ease}.lmt-btn:hover{transform:translateY(-1px);box-shadow:var(--lmt-shadow)}.lmt-btn-primary,.lmt-btn:not(.secondary):not(.lmt-btn-secondary){background:var(--lmt-navy);color:#fff!important}.lmt-btn-secondary,.lmt-btn.secondary{background:#fff;color:var(--lmt-ink)!important;border-color:var(--lmt-line-strong)}.lmt-btn-accent{background:var(--lmt-teal);color:#fff!important}.lmt-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:28px 0}.lmt-grid.two{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr))}.lmt-card{border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);border-radius:8px;background:var(--lmt-surface);padding:20px;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.03);transition:transform .16s ease,border-color .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease}.lmt-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--lmt-line-strong);box-shadow:var(--lmt-shadow)}.lmt-card h2,.lmt-card h3{margin:0 0 8px;line-height:1.22;letter-spacing:0}.lmt-card p{color:var(--lmt-muted);margin:0 0 12px}.lmt-section{border-top:1px solid var(--lmt-line);padding-top:34px;margin-top:34px}.lmt-section h2{font-size:clamp(26px,3vw,38px);line-height:1.15;margin:0 0 14px;letter-spacing:0}.lmt-section h3,.lmt-post h3{font-size:22px;line-height:1.25;margin:24px 0 10px;letter-spacing:0}.lmt-post h2{font-size:clamp(25px,3vw,34px);line-height:1.18;margin:34px 0 12px;letter-spacing:0}.lmt-muted,.lmt-small{color:var(--lmt-muted)}.lmt-small{font-size:14px}.lmt-note,.lmt-trustbar{border:1px solid #edd5c8;border-left:4px solid var(--lmt-orange);background:#fff7f3;border-radius:8px;padding:16px 18px;margin:22px 0;color:#4e2b1f}.lmt-trustbar{max-width:1120px;margin:18px auto;padding:14px 18px;display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 18px;align-items:center;font-size:14px}.lmt-trustbar strong{color:var(--lmt-ink)}.lmt-trustbar a{font-weight:700}.lmt-table{overflow-x:auto;margin:20px 0}.lmt-table table,.lmt-table{width:100%;border-collapse:collapse}.lmt-table th,.lmt-table td{border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);padding:12px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}.lmt-table th{background:#f3f1eb;color:var(--lmt-ink)}table.lmt-table th,table.lmt-table td{border-bottom:1px solid var(--lmt-line);padding:12px 10px;text-align:left;vertical-align:top}.lmt-pill{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;border:1px solid #cfe3dc;background:#edf7f3;color:#075747;border-radius:999px;padding:4px 9px;font-size:12px;font-weight:750}.lmt-faq details{border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:16px 18px;margin:10px 0}.lmt-faq summary{font-weight:800;cursor:pointer}.lmt-related{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);border-radius:8px;padding:20px;margin:34px auto;max-width:1120px}.lmt-related h2{margin-top:0}.lmt-related-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px}.lmt-related a{display:block;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);border-radius:8px;background:#fbfaf7;padding:14px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:750;color:var(--lmt-ink)}.lmt-related a:hover{border-color:var(--lmt-teal);color:var(--lmt-teal)}.lmt-feature{background:var(--lmt-navy);color:#fff;border-radius:8px;padding:22px}.lmt-feature p{color:#d8deea}.lmt-metric-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;margin:22px 0}.lmt-metric{background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);border-radius:8px;padding:16px}.lmt-metric strong{display:block;font-size:24px;line-height:1.2}.lmt-index-list{display:grid;gap:10px;margin:20px 0}.lmt-index-item{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) auto;gap:12px;align-items:center;background:#fff;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line);border-radius:8px;padding:14px;text-decoration:none!important;color:var(--lmt-ink)!important}.lmt-index-item span{color:var(--lmt-muted);font-size:14px}.lmt-index-item:hover{border-color:var(--lmt-teal);box-shadow:var(--lmt-shadow)}@media(max-width:900px){.lmt-hero-split,.lmt-grid,.lmt-grid.two,.lmt-related-grid,.lmt-metric-row{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lmt-actions .lmt-btn{width:100%}.lmt-wrap,.lmt-hub,.lmt-blog{padding:22px 16px;font-size:16px}.lmt-trustbar{margin-left:16px;margin-right:16px}.lmt-index-item{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lmt-h1{font-size:34px}}\n\nmain h1.wp-block-post-title{max-width:1120px;margin:54px auto 24px!important;padding:0 18px;font-size:clamp(38px,4.5vw,58px)!important;line-height:1.08!important;font-weight:680!important;letter-spacing:0!important;color:var(--lmt-ink)}.wp-block-post-content{margin-top:0!important}.lmt-blog,.lmt-hub,.lmt-wrap{padding-top:18px}@media(max-width:900px){main h1.wp-block-post-title{margin:30px auto 16px!important;font-size:32px!important}.lmt-blog,.lmt-hub,.lmt-wrap{padding-top:12px}}</style><style id=\"lmt-ux-polish-v3\">.lmt-image-hero{max-width:1120px;margin:18px auto 30px;padding:0 18px}.lmt-image-hero img{display:block!important;width:100%!important;height:auto!important;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line,#dedbd2);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.04),0 14px 34px rgba(31,37,32,.10);background:#fff}.lmt-image-hero figcaption{margin-top:9px;color:var(--lmt-muted,#626861);font-size:13px;line-height:1.45}.wp-block-post-featured-image img,.wp-block-image img{height:auto;border-radius:8px;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line,#dedbd2);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.04),0 10px 24px rgba(31,37,32,.08)}.wp-block-query .wp-block-post{border:1px solid var(--lmt-line,#dedbd2);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:18px;transition:transform .16s ease,border-color .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease}.wp-block-query .wp-block-post:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--lmt-line-strong,#c8c3b7);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.04),0 10px 24px rgba(31,37,32,.08)}.lmt-visual-list{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:16px;margin:22px 0}.lmt-visual-card{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line,#dedbd2);border-radius:8px;background:#fff;padding:12px;text-decoration:none!important;color:var(--lmt-ink,#1f2520)!important;box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.03);transition:transform .16s ease,border-color .16s ease,box-shadow .16s ease}.lmt-visual-card:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);border-color:var(--lmt-line-strong,#c8c3b7);box-shadow:0 1px 0 rgba(31,37,32,.04),0 12px 28px rgba(31,37,32,.10)}.lmt-visual-card img{display:block!important;width:100%!important;height:auto!important;aspect-ratio:16/9;object-fit:cover;border-radius:6px;border:1px solid var(--lmt-line,#dedbd2);box-shadow:none;background:#fff}.lmt-visual-card strong{font-size:18px;line-height:1.28;letter-spacing:0}.lmt-visual-card em{font-style:normal;color:var(--lmt-muted,#626861);font-size:14px;line-height:1.5}.lmt-card,.lmt-index-item,.lmt-related a{will-change:transform}.lmt-card h3 a,.wp-block-post-title a{text-decoration:none}.lmt-post>p:first-of-type{font-size:18px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--lmt-ink,#1f2520)}@media(max-width:900px){.lmt-visual-list{grid-template-columns:1fr}.lmt-visual-card{padding:10px}}@media(max-width:700px){.lmt-image-hero{margin:12px auto 22px;padding:0 16px}.lmt-image-hero figcaption{font-size:12px}.wp-block-query .wp-block-post{padding:15px}}</style><div class=\"lmt-hub\"><span class=\"lmt-eyebrow\">Review library</span><p class=\"lmt-lead\">LongMindTech reviews software for buyers who compare tools before they pay: AI video apps, voice tools, design tools, VPNs, proxies, and SaaS products used by small teams and creators.</p><div class=\"lmt-actions\"><a class=\"lmt-btn lmt-btn-primary\" href=\"/blog/\">Browse all articles</a><a class=\"lmt-btn lmt-btn-secondary\" href=\"/review-methodology/\">How we review</a></div><div class=\"lmt-section\">\n\n<!-- LMT_AFF_CTA_START --><style id=\"lmt-aff-cta-css\">.lmt-aff-cta .lmt-actions{display:grid!important;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(142px,1fr));gap:10px!important;margin:14px 0 0!important}.lmt-aff-cta .lmt-actions .lmt-btn{width:auto!important;min-height:42px!important;padding:10px 12px!important;font-size:15px!important;line-height:1.25!important;text-align:center!important;justify-content:center!important;white-space:normal!important}.lmt-aff-cta .lmt-actions-count-1{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}@media(max-width:480px){.lmt-aff-cta{padding:14px!important}.lmt-aff-cta .lmt-actions{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr!important}.lmt-aff-cta .lmt-actions-count-1{grid-template-columns:1fr!important}.lmt-aff-cta .lmt-actions .lmt-btn{font-size:14px!important;padding:10px 8px!important}}</style><div class=\"lmt-note lmt-aff-cta\" data-section=\"partner-links\"><p><strong>Partner links:</strong> Use these partner links to check the official product pages. We may earn a commission if you buy through these links, at no extra cost to you.</p><div class=\"lmt-actions lmt-actions-count-4\"><a class=\"lmt-btn lmt-btn-primary\" href=\"/go/invideo/\" rel=\"sponsored\" data-affiliate-link=\"true\" data-brand-name=\"InVideo\" data-link-placement=\"tool-reviews\">Check InVideo</a><a class=\"lmt-btn lmt-btn-secondary\" href=\"/go/nordvpn/\" rel=\"sponsored\" data-affiliate-link=\"true\" data-brand-name=\"NordVPN\" data-link-placement=\"tool-reviews\">Check NordVPN</a><a class=\"lmt-btn lmt-btn-secondary\" href=\"/go/iproyal/\" rel=\"sponsored\" data-affiliate-link=\"true\" data-brand-name=\"IPRoyal\" data-link-placement=\"tool-reviews\">Check IPRoyal</a><a class=\"lmt-btn lmt-btn-secondary\" href=\"/go/elevenlabs/\" rel=\"sponsored\" data-affiliate-link=\"true\" data-brand-name=\"ElevenLabs\" data-link-placement=\"tool-reviews\">Check ElevenLabs</a></div></div><!-- LMT_AFF_CTA_END --><h2>Featured review tracks</h2><div class=\"lmt-grid\"><div class=\"lmt-card\"><h3>AI video and creative tools</h3><p>Reviews for teams producing ads, social clips, product explainers, short-form content, and creator assets.</p><a href=\"/invideo-review/\">InVideo review</a><br><a href=\"/kittl-review/\">Kittl review</a><br><a href=\"/best-ai-video-generators-for-marketing-teams/\">AI video generators guide</a></div><div class=\"lmt-card\"><h3>Voice and AI production</h3><p>Coverage for voiceover tools, creator workflows, and audio production decisions where output quality and licensing matter.</p><a href=\"/elevenlabs-review/\">ElevenLabs review</a><br><a href=\"/elevenlabs-alternatives-for-creator-voiceovers/\">ElevenLabs alternatives</a></div><div class=\"lmt-card\"><h3>VPN and proxy tools</h3><p>Reviews and comparisons for privacy, geo checks, SERP research, offer QA, and residential proxy workflows.</p><a href=\"/best-vpn-proxy-tools/\">Best VPN and proxy tools</a><br><a href=\"/nordvpn-review/\">NordVPN review</a><br><a href=\"/iproyal-review/\">IPRoyal review</a></div></div></div><div class=\"lmt-section\"><h2>What makes a LongMindTech review useful?</h2><p>We write for buyers with intent. A good review should help a reader decide whether a product fits the job, what to compare it against, what risks to check, and when to skip it. We do not need every article to be a broad portal page. Narrow comparisons and practical buying notes are more valuable for affiliate SEO and paid traffic landing paths.</p><p>Our reviews are designed to support best, review, alternative, pricing, and versus content. As more partner programs are added, each review can connect into a category hub without rebuilding the site structure.</p></div><div class=\"lmt-section\"><h2>Trust and disclosure</h2><p>Some tools may have affiliate links through networks such as Impact or PartnerStack after tracking is finalized. Affiliate relationships are disclosed and do not remove the need for editorial judgment. We prefer clear recommendations, known limitations, and practical next steps over exaggerated product claims.</p><p>Read the <a href=\"/affiliate-disclosure/\">affiliate disclosure</a>, <a href=\"/editorial-policy/\">editorial policy</a>, and <a href=\"/contact/\">contact page</a> for correction requests or partnership notes.</p></div><div class=\"lmt-section lmt-faq\"><h2>FAQ</h2><details><summary>Are these hands-on reviews?</summary><p>Some pages are review-style buyer guides based on public product information, workflow analysis, and editorial checks. We avoid claiming hands-on testing unless that work has been completed and documented.</p></details><details><summary>Can new brands be added later?</summary><p>Yes. The site structure uses category hubs, review pages, and comparison pages so new affiliate programs can be added without changing the whole information architecture.</p></details></div></div><!-- LMT_SCHEMA_START --><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"CollectionPage\",\"name\":\"Software Tool Reviews\",\"url\":\"https://longmindtech.com/tool-reviews/\",\"description\":\"Independent-style SaaS, AI, VPN, proxy, and creator tool reviews from LongMindTech.\",\"isPartOf\":{\"@type\":\"WebSite\",\"name\":\"LongMindTech\",\"url\":\"https://longmindtech.com/\"}}</script><!-- LMT_SCHEMA_END -->"
